  "prompt": "You are an expert frontend developer and UI designer. Create a single-page, standalone HTML document containing a complex, animated \"System Monitor\" dashboard with a heavy Cyberpunk / Sci-Fi aesthetic.\n\nSTRICT TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS:\n1. ALL HTML, CSS, and JavaScript must be contained within a single file. Do not import external libraries (no React, no Tailwind, no external CSS). You may use Google Fonts (e.g., 'Share Tech Mono' or 'Orbitron').\n2. Do NOT output markdown code blocks (```html). Start exactly with <!DOCTYPE html> and end with </html>.\n\nLAYOUT SPECIFICATIONS:\n1. The layout must feature a permanent, fixed sidebar on the left side (approx 250px wide) containing a futuristic user profile and at least four functional-looking navigation buttons.\n2. The main content area must utilize a responsive CSS Grid structure to display at least three distinct data panels.\n\nAESTHETIC & GEOMETRIC SPECIFICATIONS:\n1. The color palette must be dark mode: deep black backgrounds (#050505), with neon cyan, hot magenta, and toxic green accents.\n2. To achieve a seamless Sci-Fi look, the primary data panels must feature an inward-curving top corner (a custom border-radius or clip-path cut-out), giving it a highly structured, non-boxy appearance.\n3. Include a subtle, semi-transparent CSS \"scanline\" overlay across the entire viewport to simulate a CRT monitor.\n\nANIMATION & INTERACTIVITY SPECIFICATIONS (JavaScript required):\n1. Glitch Effect: The main dashboard header text must feature a CSS keyframe animation that occasionally \"glitches\" (splitting colors or offsetting text for a split second).\n2. Live Telemetry: One of the grid panels must contain a \"CPU/RAM Load\" bar chart or circular progress indicator. Use JavaScript to randomly update these values and animate the bars/circles every 800 milliseconds.\n3. Terminal Output: Another panel must act as a terminal window. Use JavaScript to automatically append simulated, matrix-style data logs (e.g., \"0x00FF... BYPASSING SECURITY...\") that scroll continuously.\n\nEnsure the final output is visually stunning, responsive, and immediately interactive upon loading.\n",
  "rawOutput": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>CYBERPUNK_SYS_MONITOR_V.9.0</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --bg-dark: #050505;\n            --panel-bg: rgba(10, 15, 20, 0.85);\n            --neon-cyan: #00f3ff;\n            --neon-magenta: #ff00ff;\n            --neon-green: #0aff00;\n            --text-dim: #8899a6;\n            --border-color: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.3);\n            --font-head: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;\n            --font-body: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n        }\n\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            background-color: var(--bg-dark);\n            color: var(--neon-cyan);\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            height: 100vh;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: flex;\n        }\n\n        /* --- CRT SCANLINE EFFECT --- */\n        .scanlines {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            background: linear-gradient(\n                to bottom,\n                rgba(255,255,255,0),\n                rgba(255,255,255,0) 50%,\n                rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 50%,\n                rgba(0,0,0,0.2)\n            );\n            background-size: 100% 4px;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 9999;\n            animation: scanlineMove 10s linear infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes scanlineMove {\n            0% { background-position: 0 0; }\n            100% { background-position: 0 100%; }\n        }\n\n        /* --- SIDEBAR --- */\n        .sidebar {\n            width: 250px;\n            background: var(--panel-bg);\n            border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            padding: 20px;\n            box-shadow: 5px 0 15px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.1);\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n\n        .user-profile {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            padding-bottom: 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n        }\n\n        .avatar {\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 60px;\n            border: 2px solid var(--neon-magenta);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            margin-right: 15px;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle, #333, #000);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .avatar::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n            background: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" stroke=\"%23ff00ff\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>');\n            opacity: 0.5;\n        }\n\n        .user-info h2 {\n            font-family: var(--font-head);\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .user-info span {\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: var(--neon-magenta);\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn {\n            background: transparent;\n            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n            color: var(--text-dim);\n            padding: 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn:hover, .nav-btn.active {\n            background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.1);\n            color: var(--neon-cyan);\n            border-color: var(--neon-cyan);\n            padding-left: 25px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 3px;\n            background: var(--neon-cyan);\n            transform: scaleY(0);\n            transition: transform 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        .nav-btn:hover::before, .nav-btn.active::before {\n            transform: scaleY(1);\n        }\n\n        /* --- MAIN CONTENT --- */\n        .main-content {\n            flex: 1;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            position: relative;\n            background-image: \n                linear-gradient(rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),\n                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 30px 30px;\n        }\n\n        /* --- HEADER --- */\n        .header {\n            height: 80px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding: 0 40px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);\n            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n        }\n\n        .dashboard-title {\n            font-family: var(--font-head);\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            color: #fff;\n            text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--neon-magenta), -2px -2px 0px var(--neon-cyan);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .status-indicator {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: var(--neon-green);\n        }\n\n        .pulse-dot {\n            width: 10px;\n            height: 10px;\n            background: var(--neon-green);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            margin-right: 10px;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-green);\n            animation: pulse 2s infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse {\n            0% { opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-green); }\n            50% { opacity: 0.5; box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-green); }\n            100% { opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-green); }\n        }\n\n        /* --- GLITCH ANIMATION --- */\n        @keyframes glitch-anim-1 {\n            0% { clip-path: inset(20% 0 80% 0); transform: translate(-2px, 1px); }\n            20% { clip-path: inset(60% 0 10% 0); transform: translate(2px, -1px); }\n            40% { clip-path: inset(40% 0 50% 0); transform: translate(-2px, 2px); }\n            60% { clip-path: inset(80% 0 5% 0); transform: translate(2px, -2px); }\n            80% { clip-path: inset(10% 0 60% 0); transform: translate(-1px, 1px); }\n            100% { clip-path: inset(30% 0 50% 0); transform: translate(1px, -1px); }\n        }\n\n        .glitch-text {\n            animation: glitch-anim-1 2.5s infinite linear alternate-reverse;\n        }\n\n        /* --- GRID LAYOUT --- */\n        .grid-container {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            flex: 1;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n        }\n\n        /* --- PANELS --- */\n        .panel {\n            background: var(--panel-bg);\n            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n            padding: 20px;\n            position: relative;\n            /* Custom Sci-Fi Shape: Top-Right inward cut */\n            clip-path: polygon(\n                0 0, \n                100% 0, \n                100% 85%, \n                85% 100%, \n                0 100%\n            );\n            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.05);\n            transition: transform 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        .panel:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        .panel-header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .panel-title {\n            font-family: var(--font-head);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            color: #fff;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .panel-icon {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            color: var(--neon-magenta);\n        }\n\n        /* --- PANEL 1: TELEMETRY --- */\n        .telemetry-item {\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n        }\n\n        .telemetry-label {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .progress-bg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 12px;\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .progress-fill {\n            height: 100%;\n            background: var(--neon-cyan);\n            width: 0%;\n            position: relative;\n            transition: width 0.3s ease-out;\n        }\n\n        .progress-fill::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0;\n            background: linear-gradient(\n                90deg, \n                transparent, \n                rgba(255,255,255,0.4), \n                transparent\n            );\n            transform: translateX(-100%);\n            animation: shimmer 1.5s infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes shimmer {\n            100% { transform: translateX(100%); }\n        }\n\n        /* --- PANEL 2: TERMINAL --- */\n        .terminal-output {\n            height: 250px;\n            overflow-y: hidden;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            color: var(--neon-green);\n            text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(10, 255, 0, 0.5);\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column-reverse; /* Newest at bottom visually if we prepend, but we append so reverse helps */\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, black 20%, black 80%, transparent);\n        }\n\n        .log-line {\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n        }\n\n        .log-time {\n            color: var(--text-dim);\n            margin-right: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .log-msg {\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .log-highlight {\n            color: var(--neon-magenta);\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        /* --- PANEL 3: SYSTEM INFO --- */\n        .system-info-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .info-block {\n            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n            padding: 10px;\n            border-left: 2px solid var(--neon-cyan);\n        }\n\n        .info-label {\n            font-size: 0.7rem;\n            color: var(--text-dim);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .info-value {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #fff;\n            margin-top: 5px;\n        }\n\n        /* --- DECORATIVE ELEMENTS --- */\n        .corner-deco {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--neon-cyan);\n            border-right: 2px solid var(--neon-cyan);\n        }\n\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"scanlines\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"sidebar\">\n        <div class=\"user-profile\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\"></div>\n            <div class=\"user-info\">\n                <h2>Operator_01</h2>\n                <span>LEVEL 5 ACCESS</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"nav-btn active\">System Monitor</button>\n        <button class=\"nav-btn\">Data Network</button>\n        <button class=\"nav-btn\">Firewall</button>\n        <button class=\"nav-btn\">Settings</button>\n        <div style=\"margin-top: auto; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #555;\">\n            SYS.VER 9.0.1<br>\n            SECURE CONNECTION\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"main-content\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <div class=\"dashboard-title glitch-text\">CYBERPUNK MONITOR</div>\n            <div class=\"status-indicator\">\n                <div class=\"pulse-dot\"></div>\n                SYSTEM ONLINE\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid-container\">\n            \n            <!-- PANEL 1: LIVE TELEMETRY -->\n            <div class=\"panel\">\n                <div class=\"panel-header\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-title\">Live Telemetry</div>\n                    <div class=\"panel-icon\">\u26a1</div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"telemetry-item\">\n                    <div class=\"telemetry-label\">\n                        <span>CPU LOAD</span>\n                        <span id=\"cpu-val\">0%</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bg\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"cpu-bar\" style=\"width: 0%;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"telemetry-item\">\n                    <div class=\"telemetry-label\">\n                        <span>RAM USAGE</span>\n                        <span id=\"ram-val\">0%</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bg\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"ram-bar\" style=\"width: 0%; background-color: var(--neon-magenta);\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"telemetry-item\">\n                    <div class=\"telemetry-label\">\n                        <span>NET TRAFFIC</span>\n                        <span id=\"net-val\">0 MB/s</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bg\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"net-bar\" style=\"width: 0%; background-color: var(--neon-green);\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"corner-deco\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- PANEL 2: TERMINAL -->\n            <div class=\"panel\" style=\"grid-column: span 2;\">\n                <div class=\"panel-header\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-title\">System Logs</div>\n                    <div class=\"panel-icon\">\u2328</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"terminal-output\" id=\"terminal\">\n                    <!-- Logs injected via JS -->\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"corner-deco\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- PANEL 3: STATIC STATS -->\n            <div class=\"panel\">\n                <div class=\"panel-header\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-title\">Network Status</div>\n                    <div class=\"panel-icon\">\ud83d\udce1</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"system-info-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"info-block\">\n                        <div class=\"info-label\">Ping</div>\n                        <div class=\"info-value\">12ms</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"info-block\">\n                        <div class=\"info-label\">Upload</div>\n                        <div class=\"info-value\">450 MB/s</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"info-block\">\n                        <div class=\"info-label\">Download</div>\n                        <div class=\"info-value\">890 MB/s</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"info-block\">\n                        <div class=\"info-label\">Packet Loss</div>\n                        <div class=\"info-value\" style=\"color: var(--neon-green)\">0.0%</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"corner-deco\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- PANEL 4: SECURITY -->\n            <div class=\"panel\">\n                <div class=\"panel-header\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-title\">Security Core</div>\n                    <div class=\"panel-icon\">\ud83d\udee1</div>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\">\n                    <div style=\"width: 100px; height: 100px; margin: 0 auto; border: 2px solid var(--neon-cyan); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-cyan);\">\n                        <div style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px; border: 1px dashed var(--neon-magenta); border-radius: 50%; animation: spin 4s linear infinite;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: var(--neon-green);\">DEFENSE ACTIVE</div>\n                    <div style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-dim);\">THREAT LEVEL: LOW</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"corner-deco\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- CONFIGURATION ---\n        const terminalOutput = document.getElementById('terminal');\n        const cpuBar = document.getElementById('cpu-bar');\n        const cpuVal = document.getElementById('cpu-val');\n        const ramBar = document.getElementById('ram-bar');\n        const ramVal = document.getElementById('ram-val');\n        const netBar = document.getElementById('net-bar');\n        const netVal = document.getElementById('net-val');\n        const title = document.querySelector('.dashboard-title');\n\n        // --- TERMINAL LOGS ---\n        const logMessages = [\n            \"Initializing handshake protocol...\",\n            \"Bypassing firewall proxy...\",\n            \"Access granted to sector 7G.\",\n            \"Decrypting user data...\",\n            \"0x00FF4A... MEMORY LEAK DETECTED\",\n            \"Uploading payload to mainframe...\",\n            \"Scanning for vulnerabilities...\",\n            \"Packet loss detected. Retrying...\",\n            \"Connection established with server node 44.\",\n            \"Injecting code sequence...\",\n            \"Optimizing neural pathways...\",\n            \"WARNING: Unauthorized access attempt blocked.\",\n            \"System integrity at 100%.\",\n            \"Syncing with satellite array...\"\n        ];\n\n        function addLog() {\n            const now = new Date();\n            const timeStr = now.toISOString().split('T')[1].slice(0, -1);\n            \n            const div = document.createElement('div');\n            div.className = 'log-line';\n            \n            // Randomly highlight some messages\n            const msg = logMessages[Math.floor(Math.random() * logMessages.length)];\n            const isHighlight = Math.random() > 0.8;\n            \n            div.innerHTML = `<span class=\"log-time\">[${timeStr}]</span> <span class=\"${isHighlight ? 'log-highlight' : 'log-msg'}\">${msg}</span>`;\n            \n            terminalOutput.appendChild(div);\n\n            // Keep DOM light\n            if (terminalOutput.children.length > 15) {\n                terminalOutput.removeChild(terminalOutput.firstChild);\n            }\n        }\n\n        // --- TELEMETRY UPDATES ---\n        function updateTelemetry() {\n            // CPU\n            const cpu = Math.floor(Math.random() * 100);\n            cpuBar.style.width = cpu + '%';\n            cpuVal.innerText = cpu + '%';\n            if(cpu > 90) cpuBar.style.backgroundColor = 'var(--neon-magenta)';\n            else cpuBar.style.backgroundColor = 'var(--neon-cyan)';\n\n            // RAM\n            const ram = Math.floor(Math.random() * 80) + 10;\n            ramBar.style.width = ram + '%';\n            ramVal.innerText = ram + '%';\n\n            // Network\n            const net = (Math.random() * 500).toFixed(1);\n            netBar.style.width = (Math.random() * 100) + '%';\n            netVal.innerText = net + ' MB/s';\n        }\n\n        // --- GLITCH EFFECT TRIGGER ---\n        function triggerGlitch() {\n            title.classList.add('glitch-text');\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                title.classList.remove('glitch-text');\n            }, 800); // Duration of glitch\n        }\n\n        // --- SPIN ANIMATION KEYFRAME INJECTION ---\n        const styleSheet = document.createElement(\"style\");\n        styleSheet.innerText = `\n            @keyframes spin {\n                0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n                100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n            }\n        `;\n        document.head.appendChild(styleSheet);\n\n        // --- INTERVALS ---\n        // Update logs every 1.5s\n        setInterval(addLog, 1500);\n        \n        // Update telemetry every 800ms\n        setInterval(updateTelemetry, 800);\n\n        // Random glitch every 5-10 seconds\n        function randomGlitch() {\n            const delay = Math.random() * 5000 + 5000;\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                triggerGlitch();\n                randomGlitch();\n            }, delay);\n        }\n        randomGlitch();\n\n        // Initial calls\n        addLog();\n        updateTelemetry();\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
